information by hearing it.

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:43.176 line:92%
Some people need to see it

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:45.045 line:92%
A PowerPoint, you get both

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:47.047 align:start size:94% position:6%
