the PowerPoint

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:50.550 size:75% position:38%
and people who wanna
hear it can hear it.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:55.221
But I think what's worked is
people want the facts, you know.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.791 line:92%
This is a frightening situation.

00:00:57.791 --> 00:00:59.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's probably
the first time government

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:01.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
