00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:07.767 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, now, everything has
such spin and politics to it

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:10.270
that you get to a situatio
like this and they wanna say

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:12.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Well, just tell me
the facts, first, right?

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:15.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm not that interested
in your opinion.

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:16.576 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Give me the facts,

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:20.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I have a basis
to evaluate your opinion."

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:21.648 line:92%
And nobody was doing that.

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:25.985
And I first lay out the fact
when I'm gonna give my opinion

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:29.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
I say, you know,
"Warning -- opinion.

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:30.323 size:88% position:44% line:92%
But here are the facts."

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:31.858 line:92%
And I think that's essential

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:34.694 align:start size:94% position:6%
for people to get grounded
with where they are.

00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:37.931 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is about you and your
life and your family.

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:41.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
You want the facts
to make your own decision.

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:43.736 align:start size:94% position:6%
From my point of view,
you know,

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:47.407 size:84% position:42%
government can't really
do any of the things

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:48.842 line:92%
