00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:50.543 align:start size:94% position:6%
Government doesn't
have the power

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:54.180 line:92%
to make people stay at home.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
The only way it works is
if people

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:58.485 line:92%
understand the information

00:01:58.485 --> 00:02:03.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then accept it
and choose to follow it, right

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:04.824 line:92%
So, I say, "Here are the facts

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:07.861 align:start size:94% position:6%
and my opinion is, therefore
we should stay at home,

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:11.598 align:start size:94% position:6%
close businesses,
close schools, wear a mask."

00:02:11.598 --> 00:02:15.435 size:84% position:42%
And they have done it,
the compliance is high,

00:02:15.435 --> 00:02:18.872 align:start size:94% position:6%
because they heard the facts
and they accepted it.

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:21.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
