00:03:11.558 --> 00:03:13.860 line:92%
Then don't infect anyone else.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:16.696 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then make their life
easier, right?

00:03:16.696 --> 00:03:18.932 align:start size:94% position:6%
